ck 4</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.650" end="00:43.750">We gon' tear the club up til</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.750" end="00:47.580">Day oh me say Day oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.580" end="00:51.420">Daylight come and we don't wanna go home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.420" end="00:55.330">Yeah so we losing control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.330" end="00:59.280">Turn the lights low cause we about to get blown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.280" end="01:00.780">Let the club shut down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.700" end="01:03.170">We won't go oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.170" end="01:04.709">Burn it down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.709" end="01:07.210">To the flo oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.210" end="01:11.900">Day oh me say Day oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.900" end="01:15.120">Daylight come and we don't wanna go home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.120" end="01:18.990">We drink the whole bottle but it ain't over over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.990" end="01:22.890">Everybody jumping on the sofa sofa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.890" end="01:24.789">Standing on the chairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.789" end="01:26.730">Standing on the bar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.730" end="01:29.800">No matter day or night I'm shining</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.800" end="01:31.300">Bitch I'm a star</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.590" end="01:34.900">From the window to the wall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.900" end="01:38.150">This club is jumping, til tomorrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.150" end="01:42.509">Is it daylight or is it nightime</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.509" end="01:46.509">1 o'clock 2 o'clock 3 o'clock 4</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.509" end="01:50.520">We gon' tear the club up til</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.520" end="01:54.390">Day oh me say Day oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.390" end="01:58.340">Daylight come and we don't wanna go home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.340" end="02:02.220">Yeah so we losing control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.220" end="02:06.100">Turn the lights low cause we about to get blown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.100" end="02:07.930">Let the club shut down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.930" end="02:10.150">We won't go oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.150" end="02:11.650">Burn it down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.550" end="02:14.400">To the flo oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.400" end="02:17.970">Day oh me say day oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.970" end="02:21.990">Daylight come and we don't wanna go home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.990" end="02:29.400" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.400" end="02:33.730">I just met this sexy Haitian girl moving like a dancer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.730" end="02:37.640">Told her and her girlfriends lets meet in my cabana</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.640" end="02:41.560">Ask me where the party's at baby I'm the answer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.560" end="02:45.730">Have another drink with me shawty where your manners</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.730" end="02:49.540">Take another shot another shot shot shot shot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.540" end="02:53.410">I can make it hot make it hot hot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.410" end="02:57.310">Day oh me say Day oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.310" end="03:01.250">Daylight come and we don't wanna go home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.250" end="03:05.270">Yeah so we losing control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.270" end="03:09.700">Turn the lights low cause we about to get blown</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.700" end="03:11.200">Let the club shut down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.510" end="03:13.900">We won't go oh oh oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.900" end="03:15.400">Burn it down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.480" end="03:17.400">To the flo oh o